### Description
Tesla, Inc. is a prominent American electric vehicle and clean energy company. It has been instrumental in popularizing electric cars and innovating within the automotive sector. Initially focused on creating high-performance electric vehicles, Tesla's first model, the Tesla Roadster, garnered significant attention. Over time, under the leadership of CEO Elon Musk, the company expanded its product line to include various electric vehicles, battery energy storage solutions, and solar energy products.

### Products and Services
- Electric Vehicles (EVs): Tesla offers a range of electric cars and has engaged in selling automotive regulatory credits, maintenance services, automotive insurance, and retail merchandise.
- Energy Solutions: The company develops and installs solar panels, solar roofs, and battery storage systems for residential and grid-scale applications.

